# HPR job script generated by hpc/make_pbs.sh at 2026-10-27T07:04:49Z from scripts_project/b4_batch4.py hpc-plan (RUN_PLAN_HPC.md sections 2-3, 9); package commit 69b0b7d1aa25b5bc203538ca3c14e2c9df132f4a.
# Submit from the package folder on scratch (/hpctmp/<user>/hpr): the formal jobs through hpc/hpr_submit.sh (dependencies after:F1), the test jobs with qsub pbs/hpr_f2.pbs.
